                                "sense_id": "d952916e-857a-3d7e-b4f9-fedff2f4bea5",
                                "text": "Smiling winningly, Francis described himself as an outsider, someone “from the end of the world”, who wanted to “walk together and work together” with the crowds who greeted him, rather than tell them what to do."
                            }
